<</Type/StructElem/E(Surya and Madhuri remain deeply grateful to RAJKOV and the wider Indian diaspora for the warmth and support that helped them settle into life here in Australia. That gratitude has shaped a lasting commitment to giving back to the community.)/K[2]/P 87 0 R/S/P/Pg 19 0 R>>
endobj

214 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/E(Surya's connection with RAJKOV began in 2005, when he first arrived in Australia as an international student. He later became a Life Member upon his marriage, and soon stepped into a leadership role as Secretary of the RAJKOV Executive Committee in 2009\20510. His dedication grew from there: he went on to serve as RAJKOV President in 2013\20514, and held the offices of Secretary, Vice President, President, and Trustee with the Federation of Indian Associations of Victoria Inc.)/K[3]/P 87 0 R/S/P/Pg 19 0 R>>
endobj

215 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/E(Now largely retired from formal community leadership, Surya continues to contribute through VICHAR, a webinar series he runs to bring together diverse voices from across the community and provide a platform for their thought leadership.)/K[4]/P 87 0 R/S/P/Pg 19 0 R>>
endobj

