278 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/E(I hope this message finds you well! I wanted to take a moment to discuss something that is very dear to me\204our wonderful heritage and its significance for our future here in Australia. Our parents traveled all the way from Rajasthan, carrying with them a wealth of traditions and a vibrant culture. Now, it's our opportunity to carry that legacy forward and define what Rajasthani culture will look like for the next generation.)/K[5]/P 93 0 R/S/P/Pg 25 0 R>>
endobj

279 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/E(It doesn\220t matter if you\220re fluent in Marwari or just know a few phrases.)/K[6]/P 601 0 R/S/P/Pg 25 0 R>>
endobj

280 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/E(Whether you\220ve visited Jaipur countless times or haven\220t had the chance yet\204this community is for everyone.)/K[7]/P 602 0 R/S/P/Pg 25 0 R>>
endobj

281 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/E(Each of us contributes a unique piece to the puzzle, and that\220s what makes our community truly special. This newsletter is your platform to connect, share, and celebrate our rich heritage. Let\220s continue to build something wonderful together!)/K[8]/P 93 0 R/S/P/Pg 25 0 R>>
endobj

